flowchart TB
 INTERNET[Internet] --> HTTPS[Nginx TLS]
 HTTPS --> API[FastAPI webhook + SQLAdmin]
 ADMIN[Authorized moderator] --> HTTPS
 API --> AUTH[RBAC + per-user authorization]
 AUTH --> DB[(PostgreSQL private network)]
 PARSER[Telethon Parser] --> DB
 WORKER[Worker] --> DB
 API --> MINIO[(MinIO private network)]
 WORKER --> MINIO
 PARSER --> MINIO
 API --> LLM[Внешняя LLM: minimal sanitized context]
 API --> BOT[Telegram-бот API]
 SEC[Secrets via environment / secret files, no logs] -.-> API
 SEC -.-> PARSER
 SEC -.-> WORKER
